## Installation Artifacts

**What Gets Installed** (from first principles analysis):

**Binaries** (`~/.local/bin/`):
- `ooda` - Main CLI tool (built from `cli/main.oo`)
- `oodac` - Compiler binary (built from `oodac/main.oo`)
- `oo` - Symlink/copy of ooda CLI
- `ooda-uninstall` - Generated uninstaller script
- `ooda-init-agent` - AI agent configuration script

**Directory Structure**:
```
~/.local/share/ooda/
├── std/                    # Standard library (copied from source)
├── runtime/                # C runtime components
├── share/
│   ├── LLM_PRIMER.md       # AI agent configuration
│   ├── AGENTS.oot         # Agent specifications
│   ├── hello.oo           # Example program
│   └── templates/
│       ├── .cursorrules   # Cursor IDE rules
│       └── CLAUDE.md      # Claude AI configuration
~/.config/ooda/
└── env                    # Environment variable configuration
~/.cache/ooda/
└── src/                   # Cloned source repository
```

**Security Improvements**:
- All paths validated before use
- No silent failures or suppressed errors
- Structural comparisons instead of string matching
- Clear security notices and capability documentation
- Progressive path to full capability security

## Deployment Instructions

### For Users

**Standard Installation** (gates 1-3 certified):
```bash
curl -fsSL https://openooda.org/install.sh | bash
```

**Enhanced Security Installation** (hybrid approach):
```bash
curl -fsSL https://openooda.org/install.sh | bash
```

**Full Capability Security** (after initial install):
```bash
git clone https://github.com/openOODA/ooda.git
export OODA_CHECKOUT=/path/to/ooda
curl -fsSL https://openooda.org/install.sh | bash
```

### For Developers

**Testing the Remediation**:
```bash
cd openOODA
bash scripts/install_redteam_breaktest.sh
```

**Expected Output**: All gates show REMEDIATED status, exit code 0

